==English==

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|NL.|acapnia}}, from {{der|en|grc|ἄκαπνος||without smoke}}, from {{m|grc|ἀ-||not}} + {{m|grc|καπνός||smoke}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|en|/əˈkæp.ni.ə/|/eɪˈkæp.ni.ə/}}
* {{rhymes|en|æpniə|s=4}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# The state in which the level of [[carbon dioxide]] in the [[blood]] and [[tissue]] is significantly lower than normal.

